<p><strong><font color="blue">Time to Conquer ToFS</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, May 31, 2001 by <a href="mailto:nabbine@mmcable.com">Nabbine</a></small><br>Ok, it is time to Conquer Tower of Frozen Shadow. Friday night at 8pm Central Time we will be gathering in the Foyer of the Tower. This time we will split groups up on different levels in order to get keys and phat lewt! All are welcome to come but I am taking a select 11 up to floor 6 to start our efforts on conquering the tower. Each group going to floor 6 will be myself and 5 others where one member in each group must be able to IVU the group. We all had a blast last time even if it did get a bit slow on floor 4. This time lets go all the way and take the Tower down. Please read the ToFS thread on the raid board and take time to read and print the Detailed ToFS info on the raid board. It has been updated somewhat as to new things we have found in the Tower. Hope to see everyone there!</p>
