<p><strong><font color="blue">ToFS Report</font> </strong><small>Posted Monday, May 28, 2001 by <a href="mailto:nabbine@mmcable.com">Nabbine</a></small><br>Tonight Vallis rocked Tower of Frozen Shadow in Velious. We formed almost 3 full groups and wiped out levels 1 through 4 with ease. We remained on level 4 for the rest of the night in a holding pattern trying to get keys for all the groups. We managed to get one key and a couple nice items. We also had a couple spell drops and Nabbine finally got her Ro's Fiery Sundering! I would like to personally thank everyone for coming tonight and making this such a successful raid. Soon we will have to return and take floor 4 once again to get a few more keys so that the rest of the tower may fall to our might!</p>
