<p><strong><font color="blue">Tower of Frozen Shadow Raid</font> </strong><small>Posted Friday, May 25, 2001 by <a href="mailto:nabbine@mmcable.com">Nabbine</a></small><br>The upper mid-levels are planning a raid on the Tower of Frozen Shadow come Saturday night. So far besides Nabbine and Curunir, only two others have responded on the raid board. If you are interested in going on this raid, please post a message on the raid board. The more we have, the further we can go in the tower. Just a reminder, we had 10 people last trip and we got to floor 4 with no troubles at all. I would like to have just as many as last time since we know how to get to floor 5 now. I hope to see many of you there!</p>
