<p><strong><font color="blue">Plane of Sky Update</font> </strong><small>Posted Friday, May 18, 2001 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Hello one and all, a small merry band of us got together and inserted into the Plane of Sky tonight. After getting our first 2 keys, we headed up to the second isle. There, with Usulson's help, Sakra was able to pull the epic mob Gwan for a major battle. Vallis took him down with only 2 deaths, Sakra and Zigfree. After Nitrain rezzed Sakra, he was able to loot the item needed for his epic. And to top it off, Thorak was awarded this nice item from the first isle: Belt of Contention ac10 +5str +5sta +5svF wt0.1 effect: haste War only nodrop.<br><br>Now, we will be getting another party together for insertion to Sky and will Kill Gwan again for our other monks, then its off to isles 3 and 4. We will resume our travels across the Plane at 10 am CST. Please be on time.<br><br>More to come...</p>
